        },
        {
          "text": " Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi areeba omukhasi ali, “Siina nisio okholile sino?” Omukhasi aloma ali, “Endemu imbombeleesie mala nalia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.13",
